## 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

A comprehensive technical compliance audit was conducted against Acme Financial Systems' cloud and on-premises infrastructure. The primary objective was to evaluate operational alignment with the Enterprise Information Security Policy (EISP SEC-POL-2026-001) and regulatory frameworks (ISO/IEC 27001:2022 & NIST CSF v2.0).

The audit identified **3 major policy non-compliance findings**, including 1 Critical-risk vulnerability exposure and 2 High-risk access control failures. Immediate remediation is mandatory to prevent unauthorized system access, data exfiltration, and regulatory penalties.

